#. type: Title #
#: docs/modules/companion.md:1 docs/modules/companion.md:5
#, no-wrap
msgid "Desktop Companion"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/modules/companion.md:8
#, no-wrap
msgid "> **桌面伴侣** / **Companion**：产品功能。**伴侣浮层**（companion overlay）：Portal 透明 VRM 窗（`embedded-overlay`）。**Outpost**（前哨）：overlay 内 `remote_tools.attach` 角色。Target shell: **Tauri**（见 [`.agent/rules/tauri-shell.md`](../../.agent/rules/tauri-shell.md)）。Not managed via `config.yaml`；**禁止**再打独立 Node sidecar。\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/modules/companion.md:10
msgid ""
"The content pack (React + VRM) is embedded by the **desktop Tauri shell** "
"(`src/app/shell/tauri`). Packaged overlay loads from `frontendDist` `ui/"
"companion/` via `WebviewUrl::App` (same custom protocol as the main window — "
"**not** `file://` resources). The overlay connects with Habitat RPC, calls "
"`remote_tools.attach`, and exposes local tools (`bubble`, `play_slot`) to "
"the Agent. Product modules such as Chat use Habitat RPC only (no attach)."
msgstr ""

#. type: Content of: <messages><msg>
#: docs/modules/companion.md:11 docs/product/architecture.md:1
#: messages/po4a/en.xml:661
#, no-wrap
msgid "Architecture"
msgstr ""

#. type: Fenced code block (text)
#: docs/modules/companion.md:13
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"FreeAnima Portal (src/app/shell/tauri)\n"
"├── Tauri (Rust) — tray / multi-window + prefs / IPC\n"
"│   ├── companion overlay — work-area fullscreen transparent; VRM stage + remote_tools.attach\n"
"│   ├── companion settings — settings in main window (Habitat RPC + asset HTTP)\n"
"│   ├── chat — Chat SPA (Habitat RPC, no remote_tools.attach)\n"
"│   └── habitat — Habitat WebView (Habitat RPC REST)\n"
"└── Renderer — portalShell; overlay owns attach + tool runtime\n"
"         ↕ Habitat RPC (+ remote_tools.attach in overlay only)\n"
"    anima service Habitat (companion_profile SSOT + assets + FBX→VRMA)\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Title ###
#: docs/modules/companion.md:25
#, no-wrap
msgid "Habitat vs local boundary"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/modules/companion.md:33
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"| Layer              | Location                     | Responsibility                                                                                                                                                                   |\n"
"| ------------------ | ---------------------------- | -------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- |\n"
"| **Habitat SSOT**   | `src/features/companion/`    | `companion_profile` entity (behavior, slots, library meta); VRM/VRMA files under `~/.anima/companion/` on Habitat host; FBX→VRMA conversion; Settings read/write via Habitat RPC |\n"
"| **Settings UI**    | Desktop Settings → Companion | Habitat RPC（`getTypedHabitatClient`：`call` / multipart `callRaw`；`companion.config.*`、model/motion CRUD、asset.get）                                                         |\n"
"| **Companion host** | overlay SPA (`spa/`)         | `remote_tools.attach`, tool execution, local runtime (bubble/play); optional thin HTTP for static assets + `companion.sync.pull` cache                                           |\n"
"| **Tauri host**     | `src/app/shell/tauri/`       | Transparent window, click-through, tray, show/hide + FS / prefs IPC                                                                                                              |\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/modules/companion.md:35
msgid ""
"Management is in **Settings only** — Habitat has no companion admin page."
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/modules/companion.md:37
msgid ""
"On host start: Habitat config wins; `~/.anima/companion/config.json` on the "
"desktop is an **offline cache**. Legacy local data is migrated once to "
"Habitat (`companion.migrate.fromLocal` or HTTP upload). Multiple desktops "
"share the same model/motion library via Habitat."
msgstr ""

#. type: Fenced code block (text)
#: docs/modules/companion.md:38
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Settings ──Habitat RPC/HTTP──► features/companion (Habitat)\n"
"Static   ◄──sync.pull────► Habitat          ──► local cache (VRM/VRMA)\n"
"Overlay ──remote_tools.attach──► Habitat    （bubble / play_slot 本地执行）\n"
"Tauri   ◄──IPC──────────► Settings         (show/hide, connection status)\n"
"Agent    ──Habitat RPC tool.call─► Overlay\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/modules/companion.md:47
msgid ""
"The content pack lives in [`src/features/companion/`](../../src/features/"
"companion/) (`ui/spa/` + `server/` + `shared/`). Habitat domain logic: [`src/"
"features/companion/`](../../src/features/companion/)."
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/modules/companion.md:54
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"|            | Chat / other product modules | Companion                                        |\n"
"| ---------- | ---------------------------- | ------------------------------------------------ |\n"
"| UI         | Browser / shell Web UI       | Native transparent companion window + settings   |\n"
"| Deployment | Bundled in shell             | Dynamic attach when Habitat token is configured  |\n"
"| Protocol   | Habitat RPC only (no attach) | Habitat RPC + `remote_tools.attach` in overlay   |\n"
"| Runtime    | —                            | Overlay-local tool runtime（browser-dev 同路径） |\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Content of: <messages><msg>
#: docs/modules/companion.md:55 messages/po4a/en.xml:674
#, no-wrap
msgid "Features"
msgstr ""

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: docs/modules/companion.md:65
msgid ""
"VRM avatar rendering (Three.js + `@pixiv/three-vrm`); VRM 1.0 and 0.x auto "
"orientation correction"
msgstr ""

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: docs/modules/companion.md:65
msgid ""
"**Motion slots**: five slots — `idle`, `rest`, `walk`, `climb`, `in_place`; "
"each slot binds 0..n VRMA clips; play by id or random; empty slot = no "
"animation"
msgstr ""

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: docs/modules/companion.md:65
msgid ""
"**Speech bubble**: one-way text queue; user click advances; no auto-dismiss; "
"pushed by Habitat Agent via companion `bubble` tool"
msgstr ""

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: docs/modules/companion.md:65
msgid ""
"Transparent always-on-top **work-area fullscreen** overlay; **fullscreen "
"WebGL canvas**; character placed by in-window screen coordinates (footprint "
"160×260 for standing scale / patrol margins); avatar/bubble clickable, empty "
"area click-through"
msgstr ""

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: docs/modules/companion.md:65
msgid ""
"**Local interaction**: drag moves the character screen position (not the OS "
"window); click body to play random motion from `in_place` slot"
msgstr ""

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: docs/modules/companion.md:65
msgid ""
"**Patrol** (Settings → Behavior tab): idle patrol, double-click patrol, "
"corner pause, patrol speed, return-to-start on launch, etc."
msgstr ""

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: docs/modules/companion.md:65
msgid ""
"System tray: show/hide companion, **Settings…** (open settings window), quit"
msgstr ""

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: docs/modules/companion.md:65
msgid ""
"Settings tabs: **General** / **Behavior** / **Models** / **Motion slots** / "
"**Motion library**"
msgstr ""

#. type: Title ##
#: docs/modules/companion.md:66
#, no-wrap
msgid "Agent tools (host registration)"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/modules/companion.md:72
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"| Tool        | Parameters                           | Description                            |\n"
"| ----------- | ------------------------------------ | -------------------------------------- |\n"
"| `bubble`    | `text: string`                       | Enqueue text in speech bubble          |\n"
"| `play_slot` | `slot: string`; `motion_id?: string` | Play motion slot; `motion_id` optional |\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/modules/companion.md:74
msgid ""
"Periodic content (e.g. scheduled jokes) is configured on **anima service / "
"scheduled tasks**; the Agent calls `bubble`. Companion has no built-in timer."
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/modules/companion.md:76
msgid ""
"Settings → Companion client section shows **instance id** and **remote tools "
"connected**（overlay 上报 / ShellApi；无 token 时跳过 attach）。"
msgstr ""

#. type: Title ##
#: docs/modules/companion.md:77
#, no-wrap
msgid "Models and motions"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/modules/companion.md:80
msgid ""
"The repo **does not bundle** `.vrm` / `.vrma` files. **Habitat** is the "
"SSOT: `companion_profile` entity in PostgreSQL plus files on the Habitat "
"host at `~/.anima/companion/models/` and `motions/`. Each desktop keeps a "
"**local cache** synced on host start (`companion.sync.pull`)."
msgstr ""

#. type: Title ###
#: docs/modules/companion.md:81
#, no-wrap
msgid "VRM models"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/modules/companion.md:84
msgid ""
"Settings → **Models** tab: list, import, delete, rename, switch current "
"model. Upload goes to Habitat (`POST /rpc/v1/companion/model/upload`); host "
"downloads missing files for overlay rendering."
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/modules/companion.md:86
msgid ""
"During development, files in `src/features/companion/public/models/` serve "
"as fallback."
msgstr ""

#. type: Title ###
#: docs/modules/companion.md:87
#, no-wrap
msgid "VRMA library and slots"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/modules/companion.md:90
msgid ""
"Settings → **Motion library** tab: import VRMA, FBX, or ZIP (FBX is "
"converted on **Habitat**, not on desktop). **Motion slots** tab assigns "
"motions per slot. Preview supports mouse drag to rotate view."
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/modules/companion.md:92
msgid ""
"Unbound slots play no animation; patrol still moves the window; walk/climb "
"VRMA play only when bound."
msgstr ""

#. type: Title ###
#: docs/modules/companion.md:93
#, no-wrap
msgid "FBX import"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/modules/companion.md:96
msgid ""
"FBX→VRMA runs on the **Habitat host** (`anima service`). Desktop installers "
"no longer bundle `fbx2vrma-converter` or FBX2glTF. On the Habitat machine "
"run `just misc setup-fbx` if FBX conversion is needed."
msgstr ""

#. type: Title ##
#: docs/modules/companion.md:97
#, no-wrap
msgid "Development and run"
msgstr ""

#. type: Title ###
#: docs/modules/companion.md:99
#, no-wrap
msgid "Browser /dev companion host"
msgstr ""

#. type: Fenced code block (bash)
#: docs/modules/companion.md:101
#, no-wrap
msgid "bun src/features/companion/dev.ts\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/modules/companion.md:106
msgid ""
"Uses an in-process HTTP server; runtime events use localhost WebSocket (`/"
"api/runtime/ws`)."
msgstr ""

#. type: Title ###
#: docs/modules/companion.md:107
#, no-wrap
msgid "Desktop (Tauri Portal)"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/modules/companion.md:110
msgid ""
"The Portal companion overlay WebView hosts companion UI and "
"`remote_tools.attach`（`embedMode: embedded-overlay`；禁止 Node sidecar）。"
"Window / IPC / FS come from Tauri commands. See [`.agent/rules/tauri-"
"shell.md`](../../.agent/rules/tauri-shell.md)."
msgstr ""

#. type: Title ##
#: docs/modules/companion.md:111
#, no-wrap
msgid "Settings storage"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/modules/companion.md:114
msgid "Companion config has two storage layers:"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/modules/companion.md:119
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"| Layer                                | Content                                                                             | Access                                                |\n"
"| ------------------------------------ | ----------------------------------------------------------------------------------- | ----------------------------------------------------- |\n"
"| **Habitat PG** (`companion_profile`) | Behavior, models, motion library, slots                                             | Settings → Habitat → Companion via Habitat RPC / HTTP |\n"
"| **Local device**                     | Window visibility (`companion-shell` scope), Habitat RPC runtime status (read-only) | Settings → local → Companion                          |\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/modules/companion.md:121
msgid ""
"Local `~/.anima/companion/config.json` is only a **habitat-sync cache**; the "
"settings UI does not read/write it directly."
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/modules/companion.md:123
msgid ""
"After Habitat profile changes, the local cache syncs via "
"`companion.sync.pull`; the overlay refreshes through `emitConfigChanged`."
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/modules/companion.md:124
msgid ""
"See also: [Habitat RPC](../ops/habitat-rpc.md), [architecture companion "
"section](../product/architecture.md#desktop-companion-habitat-ssot)."
msgstr ""
